# Browser
# Tetravus at a table, Bot1 a browser page: its upkeep payment's X is a number of +1/+1 counters removed from it (CR 118.3),
# not mana, and the dock says so - "remove 2 +1/+1 counters from Tetravus" once Bot1 raises X to 2 with the stepper, never
# "{0}". Bot1 pays: two counters come off and two Tetravites are made.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Tetravus
Island x30
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Tetravus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = remove counters from Tetravus?
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = X = 2, so remove 2 +1/+1 counters from Tetravus  ·  − and + change X
Bot1.PayCost(X: 2)
[T3 Bot1.Draw]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Tetravus.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Tetravus; Tetravite Token; Tetravite Token
